            <title>[ZEPPELIN-243] The label of the Y axis does not appear correct</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-243</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi people&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We try to visualize the Bar chart. The Y-axis label of several components of the dashboard are not visualized correctly when we have million value.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;ScreenShot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0sBoSKjepK9S2pIb3lNeVhFbEk/view?usp=sharing&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0sBoSKjepK9S2pIb3lNeVhFbEk/view?usp=sharing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you help with this issue?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
