                            <comment id="14704786" author="astroshim" created="Thu, 20 Aug 2015 12:44:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello.&lt;br/&gt;
It seems like the value is just eclipsed on the left screen on the Bar chart.&lt;br/&gt;
